nal","source":"arxiv","summary":"该内容提出一种量化推理过程中技能切换难度的指标，并在此基础上构建了包含跨技能长时推理任务的评测基准，同时将该指标转化为强化学习训练信号，用于提升模型在复杂推理链中的技能切换能力。","title":"Toward Skill-Native LLMs: Skill Entropy for Benchmarking and Training Long-Horizon Reasoning"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_2af9b98df4c93e46d21b78b907cf62234e7b6a1007e1b448ecb2769c5e5e580a","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-hacker_news-position-llms-cant-jump-0-7d703edcfc/","observation_id":"obs_7d703edcfc16cd09ee95dcc98a621a78c97406cfa0bfe7b542ec1c795401b96f","published_at":"2026-08-05T11:01:37Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Position: LLMs Can't Jump"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_18c791ca3a7fc3ad4c8f8fa0c24f24a2fb9b0c9c97c26ad369a8e8ea6919b19d","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-hacker_news-zero-mem-zero-token-memory-operations-for-llm-agen-7-de3bb4f64d/","observation_id":"obs_de3bb4f64d5259fcc925e5b1c020ac96987d4cfe34e05ca89e51f0b2ef30a085","published_at":"2026-08-05T04:36:44Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Zero-Mem: Zero-Token Memory Operations for LLM Agents"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_af19d792d48ae87efbcc9659db32536896ed7835d9419fffb0f8bf4e370f22ad","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-blogs_podcasts-ainews-megakernels-are-so-dead-and-so-back-0-321af2fa26/","observation_id":"obs_321af2fa263e633335f601622e8ebd12019499a7f53b944b7a92ddffe3a92ed7","published_at":"2026-08-05T01:21:47Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"[AINews] Megakernels are so dead and so back"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_03d475bcb580e344af114928150020d0c1db404126fd90240ead9ffcc4c5e50e","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-blogs_podcasts-introducing-web-search-on-amazon-bedrock-for-found-0-80911412e4/","observation_id":"obs_80911412e4d1c0f0cf5f71d0adb2b01d83689d9ff1dfcfa41904e7e4252c4a99","published_at":"2026-08-04T18:39:14Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon Bedrock 新增了内置 Web Search 功能，让模型在需要最新网络信息时直接检索网页并生成带来源的答案，无需自行集成第三方搜索服务。该功能结合亚马逊自有的网页索引与知识图谱，以语义片段形式向模型提供精炼内容。","title":"Introducing Web Search on Amazon Bedrock for foundation model grounding"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_c0466f410ad3e232409da43671e0e7bf00c475876e7020f43561a71fcc1b705d","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-blogs_podcasts-unpacking-chatgpt-work-the-agent-for-a-billion-use-0-dfc4aca081/","observation_id":"obs_dfc4aca081a338564421c1ddb8bde723681a750c4c9f005ed5a308049148a098","published_at":"2026-08-04T18:20:14Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇对 OpenAI 近期发布的 ChatGPT Work 进行深度拆解的分析，阐述它作为知识工作代理的定位、底层云虚拟机、任务持久化机制以及与现有产品（Chat、Codex 等）的融合路线。","title":"Unpacking ChatGPT Work: the Agent for a Billion Users"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_077657f777b5a688ff3877ca87f3264db810d9812e70c623bce9f261f0cc2cfb","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-arxiv-parvl-parallel-scaling-and-expandable-compute-allo-0-15b5c9ed49/","observation_id":"obs_15b5c9ed4961c3fc228c4ece119ea08750e099b9cd5f71547bf89a60ef0d5ccc","published_at":"2026-08-04T17:59:58Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"ParVL 是一种多模态大语言模型的并行扩展方案。它在保持原有视觉编码器（ViT）和语言模型（LLM）主干参数不变的前提下，通过添加分支专属的 prefix 参数，让多个视觉和语言分支共享同一套主干，从而实现算力的并行增长并灵活调配视觉与语言之间的计算比例。","title":"ParVL: Parallel Scaling and Expandable Compute Allocation for Multimodal LLMs"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_93a0e260aeeec7bdf2a3f94a28fa4ceddcd48df628915464ad64b88fe26b5ec4","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-arxiv-societybench-forecasting-counterfactual-social-wor-0-4a45358a62/","observation_id":"obs_4a45358a628b1ee84b21b70472b0216e6b4b7d3aa2ebcea02191c27197403f3f","published_at":"2026-08-04T17:59:56Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该基准把真实社交事件的新闻和社交媒体内容整合成时间线，并将其转化为去标识化的反事实情境，用以评估语言模型在**概率校准**和**时间准确性**两个维度上的预测表现。","title":"SocietyBench: Forecasting Counterfactual Social-World Evolution"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_cfb4a26716754407193d824ca10621ac0e6ff979809ecc85511f9e1804f646cf","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-arxiv-worldcup-arena-prospective-leakage-free-evaluation-0-399723c4f1/","observation_id":"obs_399723c4f15a073fa9f60a86e93a2232fed924cebf42616e39647893cf339b0e","published_at":"2026-08-04T17:59:55Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"在2026年世界杯的赛期（39 天）里，六款具备扩展思考和服务器端搜索功能的前沿大语言模型在每场比赛开球前填写七市场预测卡，涵盖104场小组赛、12支小组冠军以及赛前全赛预测。提问时答案尚未出现，评估因此实现了无泄漏的前瞻性，冻结档案保留了4 494条已评分预测。","title":"WorldCup Arena: Prospective, Leakage-Free Evaluation of Frontier LLMs on a Live Tournament"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_7f5ba052ea6026a9f21a7f7f2de61575e2ea8df2be6d2474da25a0448a375a88","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-arxiv-turnsight-turn-level-hindsight-self-distillation-f-0-c591a1bd3a/","observation_id":"obs_c591a1bd3ab58eddc135c7c17daf506870b24da6d3454e4ef030a33f4fd569b8","published_at":"2026-08-04T17:59:21Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"TurnSight: Turn-Level Hindsight Self-Distillation for Tool-Integrated Reasoning"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":50,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.581395,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":20,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.232558,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":12,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.139535,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":11,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","jaccard":0.127907,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"cooccurrence":8,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","jaccard":0.093023,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock"},{"cooccu